2:T49b,<h2>The <span class="ident">Commercial</span> Voice</h2>
<p>Whilst the hard sell is still very well used and important in the right script, more commercials are written for a very understated, honest and reassuring natural read style. Something I’ve been developing for the last 8 years.<br>
My natural voiceover is in demand daily.<br>
Web Videos, <a href="/explainer-video-voice" class="isred" title="Explainer Videos">Explainer Videos</a> and How to Videos are on the increase and this natural, non hard sell approach is also another option for your commercials.</p>

<h2>Why use a <span class="ident">Voice</span>over?</h2>
<p>It’s pretty clear really that using a voice over will improve your brand image especially if it’s to replace something recorded by a friend on a cheap mic and a lap top. Choosing a professional voiceover will bring credibility to your brand and reflect your company’s values. Don’t let money stand in the way of your final public facing end product.<br>
Check out the demo reel here and then call or email your enquiry along with some usage details by <a href="/contact-guy" class="isred" title="contact Guy">clicking here</a>.</p>0:["wrtXmcXlkJyGqbgwCa5zJ",[[["",{"children":["commercial-voiceover",{"children":["__PAGE__",{}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["commercial-voiceover",{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"inner-page","children":[["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h1>Commercial<span class=\"ident\"> Voiceover</span></h1>\r\n<p>The Commercial Voiceover scene is a huge part of my day. Booking and delivering over 100 jobs a week.<br>\r\nYou will have heard this voice on TV & Radio. Alongside In-Store, YouTube videos and on-hold.<br>\r\nIt’s also the calm, conversational style used in the <a href=\"/apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Voice Style Voiceover\">Apple iPhone TV ads</a>, which many clients reference when requesting a natural and trustworthy tone.</p>"}}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-bar"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-parallax","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-container","children":[[["$","div","0",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>The <span class=\"ident\">Disney & Universal</span> commercials</h2>\r\n<p>You may have seen Attraction Tickets Direct on TV. <br>\r\nWorking alongside <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tXTUPXCCwd8\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Attraction Tickets Direct\">ATD</a> and Disney, I’ve been booked many times for their promotions and offers.<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.universalorlando.com/web/en/gb\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Universal Studios Tickets\">Universal Studios</a> also asked for my commercial voice to promote their latest ticket deal. These are just one of dozens of <a href=\"/vodafone-natural-voiceover\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Vodafone commercial\">commercial projects</a> I put my voice on every week.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ch6LhC-vqEA","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"inner-row reverse","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>The <span class=\"ident\">Natural</span> Voice Style</h2>\r\n<p>Over the years, I’ve been known for my character voices. I wanted to offer more and show the versatility in my straight spoken voice. Aiming for a new market, this style suits a variety of new voice projects and I’ve enjoyed every one. Have a look through the clients on my <a href=\"/voiceover-news\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Guy Harris News & Blog\">Voiceover News</a> page for more.<br>\r\nThis is how it was used for <a href=\"/hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hotels.com\">Hotels.com</a>. You’ll also hear this tone in my <a href=\"/apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Voice Style Voiceover\">Apple voiceover work</a> — ideal for clean, confident, British narration.</p>"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined",["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kxB1NMpHSes","title":"YouTube video","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"inner-row","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$2"}}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"inner-col","children":["$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/images/commercial-voiceover.png","alt":"Commercial Voiceover – Guy Harris","style":{"width":"100%","borderRadius":4,"marginTop":8}}]]}]]}]],["$","$L3",null,{"pageTitle":"Commercial Voiceovers – Apple Style from Voiceover Guy","pageUrl":"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/commercial-voiceover"}]]}]}],[["$","script","0",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"ProfilePage\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/commercial-voiceover#profilepage\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/commercial-voiceover\",\"mainEntity\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/#guyharris\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\",\"jobTitle\":\"British Commercial Voiceover Artist\",\"sameAs\":[\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/voiceoverguy/\",\"https://www.youtube.com/user/voiceoverguyharris\"],\"description\":\"Guy Harris is a leading UK commercial voiceover artist for TV, radio, and digital campaigns. Trusted by brands like Disney, Apple, Hotels.com, Heart, Capital, Smooth, Bauer and more.\"}}"}}],["$","script","1",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"LocalBusiness\",\"@id\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/#business\",\"name\":\"Guy Harris Voiceover\",\"image\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/images/guy-harris-voiceover.png\",\"url\":\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/commercial-voiceover\",\"priceRange\":\"£100–£5000\",\"address\":{\"@type\":